@startuml
title Use Case 4.2: Medical Record View
actor User
participant AnimalDetail.vue
participant medicalRecords.ts
participant medical_records.py
participant medical_record_service.py
database MySQL

User -> AnimalDetail.vue: View animal detail
AnimalDetail.vue -> medicalRecords.ts: getMedicalRecords(animal_id)
medicalRecords.ts -> medical_records.py: GET /animals/{id}/medical-records
medical_records.py -> medical_record_service.py: list_medical_records()
medical_record_service.py -> MySQL: SELECT medical_records WHERE animal_id
MySQL --> medical_record_service.py: records[]
medical_record_service.py --> medical_records.py: records
medical_records.py --> medicalRecords.ts: 200 OK
medicalRecords.ts --> AnimalDetail.vue: records
AnimalDetail.vue --> User: Display medical history
@enduml